---
---
<section class="py-5 sm:py-8" aria-label="Introduction">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1.18fr_0.82fr] gap-6 sm:gap-8 items-center">
    <div>
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#080710]/60 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-md px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-[11.5px] sm:text-xs font-semibold text-[#efeaff] max-w-full">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#4ade80] shadow-[0_0_0_4px_rgba(74,222,128,0.18)] flex-none" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="truncate sm:whitespace-normal">
          <span class="i18n-en">Open to SWE internships &amp; freelance projects</span>
          <span class="i18n-th">เปิดรับฝึกงาน Software Engineer &amp; งานฟรีแลนซ์</span>
        </span>
      </span>

      <h1 class="font-heading text-3.5xl sm:text-5.5xl lg:text-7xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-[1.02] sm:leading-[0.95] mt-4 mb-2 text-white drop-shadow-[0_2px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.45)]">
        Khetsophon<br />Ainautoon
        <span class="i18n-th i18n-th-block font-thai-title font-semibold text-base sm:text-xl lg:text-2xl tracking-normal text-[#ffe9c7] mt-2 sm:mt-2.5 leading-snug">
          เขตโสภณ อินอุตออน — “เขต”
        </span>
      </h1>

      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg lg:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed text-[#f1ebff] max-w-[620px] mt-3 drop-shadow-[0_1px_18px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)]">
        <span class="i18n-en">Full-Stack Developer &amp; Founder — building <em class="not-italic text-[#ffb347]">edge-first web platforms</em> from Bangkok.</span>
        <span class="i18n-th">Full-Stack Developer &amp; ผู้ก่อตั้ง — เชี่ยวชาญการสร้าง <em class="not-italic text-[#ffb347]">Edge-first Web Platforms</em> จากกรุงเทพฯ</span>
      </p>

      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm lg:text-[15.5px] text-[#e0ddeb] max-w-[620px] mt-3 leading-relaxed drop-shadow-[0_1px_12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.55)]">
        <span class="i18n-en">Third-year Computer Science student at Sripatum University (GPAX 3.90), and freelance developer who shipped a production site for a paying client. I think in systems first — architecture, trade-offs, data flow — then ship real, working products.</span>
        <span class="i18n-th">นักศึกษาชั้นปีที่ 3 สาขาวิทยาการคอมพิวเตอร์ มหาวิทยาลัยศรีปทุม (เกรดเฉลี่ยสะสม 3.90), และฟรีแลนซ์ผู้ส่งมอบงานระบบจริงให้แก่ลูกค้า ผมเน้นคิดเชิงระบบเป็นอันดับแรก ทั้งสถาปัตยกรรม การประเมินข้อดีข้อเสีย การไหลของข้อมูล และส่งมอบผลิตภัณฑ์ที่ใช้งานได้จริง</span>
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row flex-wrap gap-2.5 mt-5">
        <a class="i18n-en inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm px-4 py-2.5 sm:py-3 rounded-xl bg-white text-[#141126] hover:bg-[#f0f0f0] hover:border-[#f0f0f0] active:scale-[0.98] border border-white transition-all duration-200 text-center" href="/Khetsophon_Ainautoon_CV_English.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <span class="">My CV</span>
        </a>
        <a class="i18n-th inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm px-4 py-2.5 sm:py-3 rounded-xl bg-white text-[#141126] hover:bg-[#f0f0f0] hover:border-[#f0f0f0] active:scale-[0.98] border border-white transition-all duration-200 text-center" href="/Khetsophon_Ainautoon_Resume.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <span class="">Resume</span>
        </a>
        <a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm px-4 py-2.5 sm:py-3 rounded-xl bg-[#0a0914]/60 backdrop-blur-md text-white border border-white/20 hover:border-white/40 hover:bg-[#141224]/75 transition-all duration-200 text-center" href="https://github.com/hazeco" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          GitHub · @hazeco ↗
        </a>
        <a class="nav-view-link inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm px-4 py-2.5 sm:py-3 rounded-xl bg-[#0a0914]/60 backdrop-blur-md text-white border border-white/20 hover:border-white/40 hover:bg-[#141224]/75 transition-all duration-200 text-center" href="#contact" data-target-view="contact">
          <span class="i18n-en">Contact me</span>
          <span class="i18n-th">ติดต่อผม</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 sm:gap-2 mt-4.5" aria-label="Quick facts">
        <span class="font-mono-code text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-[#e9e2ff] border border-white/10 bg-[#080710]/55 backdrop-blur-md px-2.5 py-1 sm:py-1.5 rounded-full inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#ffb347] flex-none" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z" />
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
          </svg>
          <span class="i18n-en">Bangkok, Thailand</span>
          <span class="i18n-th">กรุงเทพฯ ประเทศไทย</span>
        </span>
        <!-- <span class="font-mono-code text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-[#e9e2ff] border border-white/10 bg-[#080710]/55 backdrop-blur-md px-2.5 py-1 sm:py-1.5 rounded-full">TypeScript · Next.js · Cloudflare</span> -->
        <span class="font-mono-code text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-[#e9e2ff] border border-white/10 bg-[#080710]/55 backdrop-blur-md px-2.5 py-1 sm:py-1.5 rounded-full">
          <span class="i18n-en">TH native · EN conversational</span>
          <span class="i18n-th">ไทย (เจ้าของภาษา) · อังกฤษ (สื่อสารได้)</span>
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Portrait Stage -->
    <figure class="portrait-stage relative flex justify-center items-start pt-1.5 m-0 order-first lg:order-none max-w-full">
      <div class="portrait-halo absolute -top-[3%] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[94%] aspect-square rounded-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_50%_42%,rgba(255,179,71,0.5),rgba(233,64,122,0.22)_52%,transparent_72%)] blur-[30px] pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="portrait-arch absolute bottom-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[min(72vw,300px)] lg:w-[78%] h-[76%] bg-[#12101f]/55 border border-white/10 rounded-t-[230px] rounded-b-[22px] pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      
      <img
        class="portrait relative z-10 w-[min(62vw,262px)] lg:w-[348px] h-auto block portrait-mask"
        src="/portrait.png"
        width="672"
        height="896"
        alt="Portrait of Khetsophon Ainautoon"
        loading="eager"
      />
      
      <figcaption class="portrait-chip absolute z-20 bottom-3 sm:bottom-4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#06050c]/90 border border-white/20 rounded-full px-3 sm:px-3.5 py-1.5 sm:py-2 text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-bold text-white shadow-xl max-w-[92vw]">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 sm:w-2 sm:h-2 rounded-full bg-[#ffb347] flex-none" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="text-[#ffb347] i18n-en">GPAX 3.90</span>
        <span class="text-[#ffb347] i18n-th">เกรดเฉลี่ยสะสม 3.90</span>
        <span class="text-[#c9c2dc] font-medium i18n-en">· Computer Science, SPU</span>
        <span class="text-[#c9c2dc] font-medium i18n-th">· วิทยาการคอมพิวเตอร์, ม.ศรีปทุม</span>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>
